WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.609 --> 00:00:03.150
SPEAKER: Looking for a database
service that will free you up

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:06.180
from thankless administrative
and management tasks?

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:08.670
Google Cloud Spanner,
the horizontally scalable

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:11.280
relational database
service, offers industry

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:13.830
leading five nines availability.

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:15.600
Meaning the database
behind your app

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:20.520
has 10 times less downtime
than other databases.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.290
Plus, it's simple to deploy.

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:25.530
And scaling up is as
easy as two clicks.

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:28.440
Automation of complex tasks
like partitioning data

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:31.500
across a database and global
synchronous replication

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:35.220
are built in as standard--
not as expensive add-ons.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:39.060
This frees up your IT resource
to focus on what's important--

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:40.560
your application.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.300
With a simplified
pricing model that

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:45.480
removes unnecessary
complexity and Google-grade

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:48.300
security included by
default, Cloud Spanner

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:50.910
has all the ingredients
required to simplify

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:52.700
database management.

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:56.730
With Google Cloud Spanner,
there's less administration.

00:00:56.730 --> 00:01:00.290
Meaning you can
focus on innovation.

